{"3797770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Pixel Dawn", "steam_appid": 3797770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal post-apocalyptic world where every run is a gamble. Explore dangerous biomes, fight deadly enemies, and escape before it’s too late  or lose everything you’ve collected..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mutated creatures and deadly anomalies using a mix of firearms and powerful magic. Adapt your playstyle to survive each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing. Gather resources, discover rare gear, and unlock experimental weapons and spells to grow stronger over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, return to your hideout. Upgrade your loadout, craft tools, and prepare for the next mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.poster.avif?t=1785505500\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.webm?t=1785505500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.mp4?t=1785505500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal post-apocalyptic world where every run is a gamble. Explore dangerous biomes, fight deadly enemies, and escape before it’s too late  or lose everything you’ve collected..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mutated creatures and deadly anomalies using a mix of firearms and powerful magic. Adapt your playstyle to survive each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing. Gather resources, discover rare gear, and unlock experimen